{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/44e9307c7d339e4b96f160b5cdd3d130.webp?t=1773736620\" width=768 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/3b6eceea9e643e0ade4db47f1e00e51e.poster.avif?t=1773736620\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/3b6eceea9e643e0ade4db47f1e00e51e.webm?t=1773736620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/3b6eceea9e643e0ade4db47f1e00e51e.mp4?t=1773736620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through dimensions and discover a world apart from everything you\u2019ve seen before. Guide Rei through a journey where morality, adventure, and emotion will fill your mind as you progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/3c3f258cebdfc40f6bfc7ed95b9b120e.webp?t=1773736620\" width=768 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/44f83519b885d34c35dcb667a4b8b0c6.poster.avif?t=1773736620\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/44f83519b885d34c35dcb667a4b8b0c6.webm?t=1773736620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/44f83519b885d34c35dcb667a4b8b0c6.mp4?t=1773736620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience a journey of fantasy through a world full of variety and biomes. Fly through the air, walk across the land, swim and dive in the deep waters to find new mysteries, items, tools, and quests to unlock new possibilities. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/5fac089820b7ee2df4075b2f1e5f82e0.poster.avif?t=1773736620\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/5fac089820b7ee2df4075b2f1e5f82e0.webm?t=1773736620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/5fac089820b7ee2df4075b2f1e5f82e0.mp4?t=1773736620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/0a6ff8327af46e30cecd26daea15a1f1.webp?t=1773736620\" width=768 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/1708c3eb38a7ba2ba4a52ae43b439d57.poster.avif?t=1773736620\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/1708c3eb38a7ba2ba4a52ae43b439d57.webm?t=1773736620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/1708c3eb38a7ba2ba4a52ae43b439d57.mp4?t=1773736620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between your adventures, take the time to breathe and explore as you will discover beautiful places and gather unique resources which you can sell and collect to expand your knowledge about this world and fill your compendium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/d750a88b86c934d89bda7ea55d70c48d.webp?t=1773736620\" width=800 height=52 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/cf8e17a630cd31f5c5944ea55e2c45e7.poster.avif?t=1773736620\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/cf8e17a630cd31f5c5944ea55e2c45e7.webm?t=1773736620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/cf8e17a630cd31f5c5944ea55e2c45e7.mp4?t=1773736620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will not be a calm river; you will have to face dangers that you could never have imagined. Fight your way using tools, equipment, and different fighting forms that will make your experience unique. If you ever feel lonely, summon your pets who can either aid you or be a big cuddly plush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/47caa34b17e8906b0f69abf3f735b3fb.webp?t=1773736620\" width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/9e48d5d10fe26e4a76552cd72aebf082.poster.avif?t=1773736620\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/9e48d5d10fe26e4a76552cd72aebf082.webm?t=1773736620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/extras/9e48d5d10fe26e4a76552cd72aebf082.mp4?t=1773736620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Rei progresses in the story, you will discover more about his condition, but also about the world you now live in. A world closer to its end than ever, that only you can save and bring hope to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do you say, adventurer? Are you ready for a new adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3367720?t=1773736620","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/00c26955e26b5f3686fcb19d508c7b954ff306d3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773736620","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/fac1d671d2b55f29f049548d5fc446700f22f5f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773736620","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367720/fac1d671d2b55f29f049548d5fc446700f22f5f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773736620","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite